# copy is PERMISSION_ATTESTATION_PUBLIC.md), the per-book census and the per-file audit.
docs/execution/PERMISSION_ATTESTATION.md
data/holyword/inventory_snapshot.json
docs/execution/LIBRARY_RETROSPECTIVE_AUDIT.csv
research/THE_HOLY_WORD_CATALOG_SNAPSHOT.md
